The Autograph Collectors Club of India is the only club of its kind in India for the promotion of autograph collecting as a hobby. 
We are a family of nearly 3000 members, many of whom are record holders. If you like collecting autographs, or would want to take up autograph collection, we would welcome you to become members of the club.
